Package: tind-gaming
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: dkms, linux-headers-amd64, nvidia-driver, nvidia-kernel-dkms, nvidia-vulkan-icd, nvidia-detect, mesa-vulkan-drivers, libgl1-mesa-dri, mesa-va-drivers, mesa-vdpau-drivers, firmware-amd-graphics, vulkan-tools, mesa-utils, pciutils, steam-devices, gamemode, mangohud
Recommends: nvidia-settings, intel-media-va-driver-non-free, mokutil
Installed-Size: 4
Description: Tind gaming base: graphics drivers, Vulkan, controller rules
 NVIDIA proprietary driver (DKMS, rebuilt automatically for new kernels),
 Mesa Vulkan and VA-API for AMD and Intel, AMD graphics firmware, GameMode,
 MangoHud, Steam controller udev rules, and Steam-friendly kernel settings.
 Steam, Lutris, Heroic and ProtonUp-Qt are installed on request through
 Tind Apps (Flatpak). A boot-time check falls back to the open nouveau driver
 when an NVIDIA card is too old for the packaged driver.
